{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415705","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415705","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1041570501:0":{"text":"あんたが、戦神ブルータス？","source_cn":"你就是他们说的战神，布鲁特斯？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3878DEE9A94A5967","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1041570502:0":{"text":"全然神らしくないな。","source_cn":"你一点也不像神明。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3E61292169DBB388","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041570503:0":{"text":"ほう？お前の言う「神らしい」とは何だね？","source_cn":"哦？你觉得神应该是什么样？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x48EFC5D84922A050","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041570504:0":{"text":"さあ。おれも神とはそんなに会ったことがないからな。","source_cn":"我见过的神不多。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6FC32D001AE67528","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041570505:1":{"text":"けど、同族が信仰していた神は……血を好み、傲慢で、信徒を蔑んでいた。","source_cn":"但我同族所信仰的神明……嗜血，傲慢，蔑视信徒。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBD7DE4CE2F0C9175","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041570506:1":{"text":"若者よ、お前の目は憎しみに満ちている。","source_cn":"年轻人，我看得出你眼中充斥着仇恨。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0F77E29CE93C5B03","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041570507:1":{"text":"……","source_cn":"……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4D94AD9463C9058","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041570508:1":{"text":"もっと肩の力を抜け。「戦神」など、ただの称号でしかない。","source_cn":"放松点吧。所谓之“战神”，不过是一个荣耀的称号。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5D504932C0B5734E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1041570509:1":{"text":"いつの日か誰かが我を倒し、その称号を受け継ぐのだ。","source_cn":"终有一日，这个称号会由击败我的人继承。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8166895E4F179431","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1041570510:1":{"text":"お前は優秀な戦士のようだな。試練を乗り越え、戦歌祭で我と干戈を交える機会があれば、次にこの称号を手にするのはお前かもしれんぞ。","source_cn":"看得出你是一名优秀的战士。若是你能通过试炼，在战歌节上...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x110610C3BF198315","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1041570511:1":{"text":"試練？戦歌祭！？……そ、それはどんな祭りなんだ？","source_cn":"试炼？节日？！……你们要做什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x43ADD54CDA06B9B4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1041570512:1":{"text":"互いに腕を競い、自然に挑み、智慧で謎を解き明かす。必要とあらば、敵と協力することもある。","source_cn":"切磋武艺，挑战天险，用智慧破解谜题，必要时与对手合作。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB4949CDCDAF6B0CC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1041570513:1":{"text":"む？なぜそんなに緊張しているのだ？","source_cn":"你为什么这么紧张？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8E621B6F9E55CF5E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1041570514:1":{"text":"……それだけか？","source_cn":"……只有你说的这些？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB1C599BFB3E83BE1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1041570515:1":{"text":"ああ、それで十分だ。","source_cn":"这已经非常全面。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6A54CDDE150084E9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1041570516:1":{"text":"むしろ、戦士の証明にそれ以外のものが必要かね？","source_cn":"除了这些，你觉得战士还需要什么样的证明？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4EBD10DA902E6832","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1041570517:1":{"text":"い、いや。あんたたちの風習をよく知らないから……","source_cn":"……不，不需要。我只是不了解你们的习俗。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB269DDC52E81CA79","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1041570518:1":{"text":"ははっ、なら、これで分かったであろう？","source_cn":"哈哈，那你现在了解了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x33CE853EA9EDE407","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1041570519:1":{"text":"お前が我に挑む日を楽しみにしているぞ。","source_cn":"我很期待你向我发起挑战的那一天，年轻人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFC32F4374EC3183E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:那非":{"text":"ネフィル","source":"那非","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:布鲁特斯":{"text":"ブルータス","source":"布鲁特斯","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":20,"localized_text_count":19,"speaker_count":2}}